## Do While
A `do while` loop runs at least once, then checks the condition:
```ts
do {
    code;
} while (condition);
```
Unlike `while`, the code runs BEFORE the check.
---
## Assignment:
MeTube's video player retries buffering until it succeeds. Create a variable `attempts` set to 0. Use a do-while loop to print `Buffering...` and increment attempts. Stop when attempts reaches 3. After the loop, print `Video ready!`.
